title: "4-2: Who Rows With You"
target: stage.c4s2
once: user
---

## Midwater

@narrator: Halfway out, the lanterns bunch around the boat like cats at a door.
@lumi: Someone should keep watch at the bow. Who do you trust with that?
<branch id="c4s2Watch" prompt="Who keeps watch at the bow?">
  <choice id="aria" label="Aria." when="holds('owned', ['aria'])">
    @aria{emotion="happy"}: Me? Of course. I'll call out every star I see. Loudly.
    ::assert{rowedWith(aria)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="cyra" label="Cyra." when="holds('owned', ['cyra'])">
    @cyra{emotion="sleepy"}: I'll watch. With my eyes closed. It's a priestess thing.
    ::assert{rowedWith(cyra)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="nyx" label="Nyx." when="holds('owned', ['nyx'])">
    @nyx{emotion="shy"}: The lanterns know me. They'll behave.
    ::assert{rowedWith(nyx)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="lumi" label="Lumi can do it.">
    @lumi{emotion="smug"}: Obviously. I'm a guide star. Guiding is the job.
  </choice>
</branch>
